{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"StreamHealth"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"mentions","mentions":["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost\/SessionLifecycle"]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","level":2,"text":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A capture that stops (macOS ended it, the display went away) or a pipeline that can’t start is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rebuilt at once on anything that may have fixed it (the Mac waking, its session becoming","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"active, its network changing, its displays settling after a change), and otherwise after a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"wait, never giving up while a device wants the stream. A capture that stopped waits the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"short time each time. A start that failed, whatever stopped it (a capture that gave no first"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"frame, a display gone by the time the capture started), waits longer each time in a row on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"schedule the device asks a silent stream again on (","type":"text"},{"code":"StallBackoff","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), until a first frame forgets","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the streak. Screen Recording turned off is not retried: the permission check brings it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"back. A software encoder that keeps hanging is not retried either: it waits for Try Again.","type":"text"}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/HeadwireMacHost\/documentation\/HeadwireMacHost"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:15HeadwireMacHost12StreamHealthV","n